-        and ``ActivationType.Relu2`` for non-gated ReLU^2. Setting
-        ``situ_beta`` selects SiTU; ``swiglu_oai`` is represented as
+        SwiGLU or parameterized SiTU, ``ActivationType.Situ`` for direct SiTU
+        using swiglu_alpha/beta, ``ActivationType.GegluTanh`` for
